6. What has not been demonstrated

I have not verified that the repository currently runs as a fully integrated autonomous cognitive operating system, persists its own learning across arbitrary models, automatically improves its underlying model weights, or generates validated new capabilities without human intervention.

The README describes those mechanisms and ambitions, but its specifications alone don’t establish that all those systems operate end to end. GitHub

Our seed does something narrower and real: deterministic operator composition, structural checking, and candidate persistence.

